OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FThe family of a woman from Portsmouth
OL,8,Fbelieved to have been murdered in
OL,9,FFlorida after disappearing from her UK
OL,10,Fhome said she was a "truly beautiful
OL,11,Fperson" and "the gentlest soul".
OL,13,FSonia Exelby was reported missing from
OL,14,Fher address in Southsea on October 12
OL,15,Flast year, by which time initial
OL,16,Fpolice inquiries established she had
OL,17,Falready left the country.
OL,19,FHer body was found by US investigators
OL,20,Fin Marion County, Florida, on October
OL,21,F17.
OL,26,@rD@UOUsD@GO]sD@MOUsD@_O]
