OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FDwain Hall, 53, of Ocala, was
OL,8,Fsubsequently arrested on charges of
OL,9,Ffirst-degree murder and kidnapping by
OL,10,Fthe Florida Department of Law
OL,11,FEnforcement (FDLE).
OL,13,FHe had already been detained over the
OL,14,Falleged fraudulent use of Ms Exelby's
OL,15,Fcredit cards.
OL,17,FHall is expected to face trial in
OL,18,FNovember.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/8
