OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FIn a statement released by Hampshire
OL,8,Fpolice on behalf of the family, they
OL,9,Fsaid: "Sonia was a truly beautiful
OL,10,Fperson, inside and out.
OL,12,F"She had the gentlest soul ` so gentle
OL,13,Fthat she chose to become vegan,
OL,14,Fbecause she couldn't bear the thought
OL,15,Fof any animal suffering just so she
OL,16,Fcould eat. That was who she was: kind,
OL,17,Fcompassionate, and full of quiet love.
OL,26,@qD@GOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"She was incredibly talented. Sonia
OL,8,Fcould play the piano so effortlessly,
OL,9,Fand when she sang, she had the voice
OL,10,Fof an angel. Being around her felt
OL,11,Fspecial - she brought a calmness and
OL,12,Fwarmth that made everything feel a
OL,13,Flittle lighter.
OL,15,F"Sonia was one of those rare people
OL,16,Fwho made you feel completely safe to
OL,17,Fbe yourself. She never judged, never
OL,18,Fcriticised ` she simply accepted
OL,19,Fpeople as they were and loved them for
OL,20,Fit. That is something so many of us
OL,21,Fwill carry with us forever."
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU}D@\O]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/8
