OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"We will never get over losing her,
OL,8,Fwhich has left an emptiness in our
OL,9,Flives that can never be filled. The
OL,10,Fworld has lost so much kindness and
OL,11,Flight, and her absence will be felt by
OL,12,Fso many people for so many years to
OL,13,Fcome.
OL,15,F"We know that life wasn't always easy
OL,16,Ffor you, but your life was so much
OL,17,Fmore than the struggles you faced.
OL,18,FThis is so important to us that the
OL,19,Flife you lived is what you are
OL,20,Fremembered for.
OL,26,@oD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/8
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,387,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F386A1785259144
OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,F"You were deeply loved, and you will
OL,8,Falways be deeply loved. We miss you
OL,9,Fmore than words can ever say. We love
OL,10,Fyou so much, always, and forever."
OL,12,FA spokesperson for Hampshire Police
OL,13,Fsaid: "We received a report on Sunday
OL,14,FOctober 12 that Sonia was missing from
OL,15,Fher home in Southsea.
OL,17,F"Initial inquiries established that
OL,18,Fshe had travelled outside of the UK
OL,19,Fprior to the report being received."
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@bO]uD@GOUyD@AOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G7/8
