OL,3,CBritish woman believed murdered in
OL,4,CFlorida was 'gentlest soul', says
OL,5,Cfamily
OL,7,FIt said the constabulary was
OL,8,Fcontinuing to support the FDLE
OL,9,Finvestigation, while specially trained
OL,10,Fofficers were providing assistance to
OL,11,FMs Exelby's family in the UK.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G8/8
